{"3964420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hell Dice Gambit", "steam_appid": 3964420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Hell, everything is a gambit.</h2><br><strong>Hell Dice Gambit</strong> is a strategic horror roguelike where your fate hangs on every roll. Trapped in an infernal arena, you must risk your life with four cursed dice — each face carved with swords, shields, stars, skulls, crowns, and chance itself.<br><br><i>Roll. Read the hand. Risk everything.</i><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Form dice combinations</strong> using poker-style hands to deal damage, raise barriers, curse your enemy, or claim items. Every roll forces a decision: play it safe, or commit fully to a devastating combo?<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Outlast your opponent</strong> in turn-based deathmatches where timing, item management, and calculated risks determine who survives. Your enemy plays by the same rules — and they're stacking their deck too.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Stack your deck.</strong> After each victory, choose from relics that bend fate, specialized dice that shift the odds, and pills that amplify your hands. Choose wisely — your opponent draws from the same pool.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Dice-poker combat</strong> — 20+ unique combinations<br></li><li> <strong>50+ rewards</strong> — dice, relics, and pills that stack and chain into devastating synergies<br></li><li> <strong>Strategic items &amp; curses</strong> to outplay your foe<br></li><li> <strong>Roguelike progression</strong> where every risk compounds<br></li><li> <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong> — death is not an escape</li></ul><br><i>How long can you keep winning before Hell collects?</i>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Hell, everything is a gambit.</h2><br><strong>Hell Dice Gambit</strong> is a strategic horror roguelike where your fate hangs on every roll. Trapped in an infernal arena, you must risk your life with four cursed dice — each face carved with swords, shields, stars, skulls, crowns, and chance itself.<br><br><i>Roll. Read the hand. Risk everything.</i><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/dfb0cb5cd9a105c095036512ea416e09.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Form dice combinations</strong> using poker-style hands to deal damage, raise barriers, curse your enemy, or claim items. Every roll forces a decision: play it safe, or commit fully to a devastating combo?<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/9bc46d6094c18a5d43f40b54622ce6ab.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Outlast your opponent</strong> in turn-based deathmatches where timing, item management, and calculated risks determine who survives. Your enemy plays by the same rules — and they're stacking their deck too.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.poster.avif?t=1773988862\" width=800 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.webm?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964420/extras/10c994c4f430c59fe47115d8462f9ce0.mp4?t=1773988862\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Stack your deck.</strong> After each victory, choose from relics that bend fate, specialized dice that shift the odds, and pills that amplify your hands. Choose wisely — your opponent draws from the same pool.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Dice-poker combat</strong> — 20+ unique combinations<br></li><li> <strong>50+ rewards</strong> — dice, relics, and pills that stack and chain into devastating synergies<br></li><li> <strong>Strategic items &amp; curses</strong> to outplay your foe<br></li><li> <strong>Roguelike progression</strong> where every risk compounds<br></li><li> <strong>Atmospheric horror</strong> — death is not an escape</li></ul><br><i>How long can you keep winning before Hell collects?</i>", "short_description": "'Hell Dice Gambit' is a strategic roguelike game using dice. Collect various relics, dice, and pills to grow stronger and struggle on. Can you escape from the abyss of hell?", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full aud